# Battle against Necrozma (the prism, devourer of light): blinding stabs and a chromatic splinter, then the light
# line's arpeggio broken into shards on a saw lead, F minor torn by a Phrygian G-flat, over a choir and a 3-3-2
# drive. Original composition for this game.
